      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:6:7:30:3",
      "text": [
        " كَتَبْتُ إِلَى أَبِي الْحَسَنِ الْمَاضِي ( عليه السلام ) أَسْأَلُهُ عَنِ الْفُقَّاعِ فَقَالَ لَا تَقْرَبْهُ فَإِنَّهُ مِنَ الْخَمْرِ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Muhammad Bin Yahya, from Ahmad Bin Muhammad Bin Isa, from Muhammad Bin Sinan, from Husayn Al Qalanasy who said, ",
          "‘I wrote to Abu Al-Hassan Al-Maazy<sup>asws</sup> (7th Imam<sup>asws</sup>) asking him<sup>asws</sup> about the fermented drink, so he<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘Do not go near it for it is from the wine (classification)’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "3. Muhammad ibn Yahya has narrated from Ahmad ibn Muhammad ibn ‘Isa from Muhammad ibn Sinan from Husayn al-Qalanisiy who has said the following: “Once I asked abu al-Hassan, al-Madiy, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, in writing and asked about al-Fuqa ’ (beer). He (the Imam) wrote to me saying, ‘Do not go close to it; it is wine.’” "
        ]
      }
    },
